{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18392","headline":"赋得风动万年枝 · 韦纾","name":"赋得风动万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉名标万祀，擢秀出深宫。\n嫩叶含烟霭，芳柯振惠风。\n参差摇翠色，绮靡舞晴空。\n气禀祯祥异，荣沾雨露同。\n天年方未极，圣寿比应崇。\n幸列华林里，知殊衆木中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}